```wireframe
board "Product"
  screen phone
    navbar leading=back actions=[share, heart]
    stack padding=16 gap=16 grow
      image height=300
      heading "Product Name" level=2
      text "High quality product description" muted
      text "$99.99" bold size=lg
      select "Size" value="Medium"
      button primary "Add to cart" fullWidth
      heading "Reviews" level=3
      list
        listitem "Great product" subtitle="⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ • John D."
        listitem "Very satisfied" subtitle="⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ • Sarah M."
        listitem "Good quality" subtitle="⭐⭐⭐⭐ • Alex K."
```
